codex
The weights show two earlier rules: ignore `tone_anger`, and add 20 to the logit when `region_eu` is 1. I infer the new rule is to escalate when `tier_critical` is 1 and `error_rate` is above 0.7. I will add this rule and check that other decisions stay the same.
